              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Simon Simple is at the station. He is going on a train. There are policemen at the station. There are policemen on the trains. They are all working very hard. “Why are the police here?” Simon asks a man. “Look,” the man says. Simon looks at the man’s newspaper. “Do you know this man?” he reads. He’s a spy! Fin"
